code: 0
--- stdout
The issue is triaged

  From:      any status
  To:        the status is not changed
  Requires:  nothing besides the issue number
  Board:     adds the issue if it is not there
  Fields:    sets Estimate 3, Priority P1; a field already at its value is left alone

Usage:
  gh dojo triage <N> [flags]

Flags:
      --dry-run   print the plan without changing anything
  -h, --help      help for triage
--- stderr
